## Task 1: Conditional Complexity - E+ Version
## Build a decision system for user classification

## Rules:
## - If age > 18 AND score > 80 → "premium"
## - If age > 18 AND score > 50 → "standard"  
## - If score < 50 OR flagged → "review"
## - Else → "reject"

age = 25
score = 85
flagged = false

? (age > 18 and score > 80) →
    result = "premium"
else ? (age > 18 and score > 50) →
    result = "standard"
else ? (score < 50 or flagged) →
    result = "review"
else →
    result = "reject"

> result
